00:06:56.630 --> 00:07:16.710
<v Ira Glass>OK, so then what happens is that I explain, here's what we're doing on the show today. It's going to be an episode about adult children and their relationships with their adult parents. And then-- as, then, I set up the interview with my mom, I say that I told my mom that I thought that my sister, Randi, had been maybe a little harsh in the way that she put things.
