00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:32.930
<v Ira Glass>I have to say, I'm so-- I like that she gets the last word. OK, so that is the fourth time I had one of my parents on the show. The reason, I have to say, that we had my parents on the air so much in the first year of the show was because it was such reliable material.
