<v Ira Glass>And there's just something inherently entertaining about hearing some radio host who supposedly is the king of the show-- he's been running the show, this adult running the show-- and their parents just come on, and they don't give a crap. You know what I mean? Like, they really try to get the last word. And so the staff, we just knew, like, oh, what if we fill this with-- could you talk to your parents? And it was just always good material.
<v Ira Glass>而且，听着某个自诩为节目之王的广播主持人——这个掌控着节目的成年人——而他们的父母上节目却根本不鸟他，这本身就有一种天然的娱乐性。你知道我的意思吗？就像，他们真的会努力去争夺最后一句话的主导权。所以我们制作组当时就知道，哦，如果我们用这个来填满——你能跟你的父母聊聊吗？这总是能产出极好的素材。

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:47.070
