00:26:31.950 --> 00:26:49.070
<v Ira Glass>A lot of what it's like to be on the radio is just trying to sound relaxed when you're not. You're doing a show. You're not just talking to people. And in some of these tapes, I can actually hear my father struggling to sound relaxed.
<v Ira Glass>做广播的很大一部分感觉，其实就是试图在并不轻松的时候让自己听起来很放松。你在做节目。你可不仅仅是在跟人聊天。在其中一些录音里，我其实能听到我父亲为了让声音听起来放松而感到的挣扎。

00:26:49.070 --> 00:27:20.350
<v Ira Glass>And these recordings give me this picture of him that I have never had in my life, really. He seemed so young and innocent, a guy in his 20s doing this thing that I know so intimately myself, just sitting in front of a microphone, trying to sound at ease, trying to sound like this relaxed old pro, not a care in the world.
<v Ira Glass>这些录音展现了我生前从未见过的他的形象。他看起来那么年轻、那么纯真，一个二十几岁的小伙子，做着我本人也无比熟悉的事情——就坐在麦克风前，努力让自己听起来从容不迫，努力装成一个毫无烦恼、轻松自在的资深老手。

00:27:20.350 --> 00:27:52.610
<v Dad>Yes, now, you can have color in that kitchen of yours and really make it a true showplace for your family and your friends-- and make it a lot easier to work in, too, with color. And you can have this color in your kitchen all at the price of white. And Force Frigidaire features the new 1957 Frigidaire refrigerators, ranges, washers, and dryers in four decorator colors at absolutely no extra cost to you. You have your choice of pink, yellow, green, or charcoal.
<v Dad>对，现在，你可以在你的厨房里运用色彩，真正让它成为向家人和朋友展示的绝佳场所——借助色彩，也能让厨房的工作变得轻松得多。而且，你只需花白色的价格，就能在厨房里拥有这些色彩。福特·弗里吉代尔（Force Frigidaire）隆重推出1957年新款弗里吉代尔冰箱、炉灶、洗衣机和干衣机，提供四种装饰色彩，完全不收取任何额外费用。你可以选择粉色、黄色、绿色或木炭色。

