00:28:04.210 --> 00:28:21.830
<v Dad>Well, let's get on to that feature top tune of tomorrow, a brand-new release, one we think is going to be real big in the coming weeks and months all across the country and right here in Baltimore, too. This week, it goes to The Crew Cuts. Listen to their rendition of "Love in a Home."
