<v Mom>No.
<v Mom>没有。

00:51:42.340 --> 00:51:42.900
<v Ira Glass>No.
<v Ira Glass>没有。

00:51:42.900 --> 00:51:43.400
<v Mom>No.
<v Mom>没有。

00:51:43.380 --> 00:51:45.000
<v Ira Glass>No. But if you did, you're saying that--
<v Ira Glass>没有。但如果你这么做了，你是说——

00:51:45.000 --> 00:51:48.320
<v Mom>We've gone to restaurants with you and pretended we didn't know you.
<v Mom>我们跟你一起去过餐厅，然后假装不认识你。

00:51:48.320 --> 00:51:52.480
<v Ira Glass>[LAUGHS] What do you mean by that?
<v Ira Glass>[笑] 你这话是什么意思？

00:51:52.480 --> 00:51:55.660
<v Mom>Well, when you were younger, and--
<v Mom>嗯，当你还小的时候，然后——

00:51:55.660 --> 00:51:56.820
<v Ira Glass>[LAUGHS]
<v Ira Glass>[笑]

00:51:56.820 --> 00:52:03.840
<v Mom>--let's say that your manner of dressing didn't exactly conform to the style--
<v Mom>——比方说，你的穿着打扮确实不太符合那个风格——

00:52:03.840 --> 00:52:04.900
<v Ira Glass>All right, all right, all right.
<v Ira Glass>行了，行了，行了。

00:52:04.900 --> 00:52:05.400
<v Mom>--and dress--
<v Mom>——和衣着——

00:52:05.000 --> 00:52:05.760
<v Ira Glass>I think everybody-- you know.
<v Ira Glass>我想大家都——你知道的。

00:52:05.760 --> 00:52:07.720
<v Mom>--of the other people in the restaurant.
<v Mom>——餐厅里其他人的风格。

00:52:07.720 --> 00:52:09.700
<v Ira Glass>[LAUGHS]
<v Ira Glass>[笑]

00:52:09.700 --> 00:52:14.580
<v Mom>Back when Daddy-- Daddy would look at you, and he would start popping Gelusil-- [LAUGHS]
<v Mom>当年爸爸——爸爸看着你，然后他就会开始猛嚼吉胃素——[笑]

00:52:14.580 --> 00:52:15.180
<v Ira Glass>[LAUGHS]
<v Ira Glass>[笑]

00:52:15.180 --> 00:52:24.500
<v Mom>--when we'd go out to eat. And I'd say, now, Barry, people are going to look at him, they're going to look at us, and they're going to know that we did not pick out his clothes. [LAUGHS]
<v Mom>——每当我们要出去吃饭的时候。然后我就会说，好了，巴里，大家会看着他，他们会看着我们，然后他们就会知道他的衣服绝对不是我们帮他挑的。[笑]

00:52:24.500 --> 00:52:29.260
<v Ira Glass>So now that I know that you're this big sexpert, do you have any sex advice for me?
<v Ira Glass>既然我现在知道你是个这么厉害的性专家，那你有什么性方面的建议要给我吗？

00:52:29.260 --> 00:52:33.780
<v Ira Glass>I'll just say, in 2026, daring question.
<v Ira Glass>我只想说，在2026年，这个问题可真够大胆的。

00:52:33.780 --> 00:52:39.380
<v Ira Glass>So now that I know that you're this big sexpert, do you have any sex advice for me?
<v Ira Glass>既然我现在知道你是个这么厉害的性专家，那你有什么性方面的建议要给我吗？

